From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Thu, 24 Sep 2026 19:39:54 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] Convert any site-list Excel/CSV into the group/basket
 template on upload

The group quotation upload only accepted the supplier template with its exact
headings on row 1, so other site lists failed with 'No site rows found'.

A new converter (src/lib/siteConverter.js) finds the heading row on any sheet,
recognises common alternative column names (Supply Number, Meter Point
Reference, mixed MPAN/MPRN columns, full 21-digit MPANs, PC/MTC/LLF, Annual
Consumption, Contract End Date, addresses with postcodes), maps them onto the
template columns, and reports the mapping and assumptions. When a file was
converted, the rows are written into the real template for download.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
